## .gitignore برای پروژه‌های Visual Studio / .NET

# ===== Build results =====
[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/
[Dd]ebug/
[Rr]elease/
x64/
x86/
[Ll]og/
[Ll]ogs/

# ===== Visual Studio =====
.vs/
*.user
*.userosscache
*.sln.docstates
*.suo

# ===== ReSharper / Rider =====
_ReSharper*/
*.[Rr]e[Ss]harper
*.DotSettings.user
.idea/

# ===== NuGet =====
*.nupkg
*.snupkg
**/[Pp]ackages/*
!**/[Pp]ackages/build/
*.nuget.props
*.nuget.targets

# ===== Test results =====
[Tt]est[Rr]esult*/
[Bb]uild[Ll]og.*
*.trx
*.coverage
*.coveragexml

# ===== Rider / VS Code =====
.vscode/
*.DotSettings

# ===== OS files =====
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# ===== Publish / Deployment =====
[Pp]ublish/
*.publishsettings
PublishScripts/
*.azurePubxml

# ===== ASP.NET / Blazor specific =====
wwwroot/lib/
*.pfx

# ===== User-specific / secrets =====
*.env
appsettings.*.json
!appsettings.json
!appsettings.Development.json
secrets.json

# ===== Misc =====
*.tmp
*.bak
*.swp
*~
